   abstract = {A review with many refs. of photosynthetic H2 prodn. by various organisms, esp. eukaryotes. It includes a general characterization of the catalyzing enzymes (hydrogenase and nitrogenase), quantum efficiency, the kinetics and mechanism of H2 photoevolution, the distribution and activity of H2 photoproducers (33 genera of eukaryotes), physiol. functions of this process as well as recent developments in photobiol. hydrogen technol. [on SciFinder(R)]},
